        Deprecated since 2.22: Use Gio.Volume.eject_with_operation() instead.

        Args:
            flags: flags affecting the unmount if required for eject
            cancellable: optional Gio.Cancellable object, None to ignore
            callback: a Gio.AsyncReadyCallback, or None
