        implementations should instead create shadow mounts with the URI of
        the mount they intend to adopt. See the proxy volume monitor in
        gvfs for an example of this. Also see Gio.Mount.is_shadowed(),
        Gio.Mount.shadow() and Gio.Mount.unshadow() functions.

        Args:
            mount: a Gio.Mount object to find a parent for

        Returns:
            the Gio.Volume object that is the parent for mount or None
                if no wants to adopt the Gio.Mount.
        """
